## Event Lighting

Two real products sit under event lighting technology. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) includes 2 light bars with RGBW LED spotlights, a color changing accent fixture you run yourself, published at 290 euros ex VAT for up to 50 guests. Our equipment catalog also lists Beam/Spot moving head fixtures and control systems for larger corporate stages, the kind of wash and beam effect you would want lighting a keynote stage or a gala dance floor rather than a small private party.

We do not publish a standalone package line or a fixed price for the moving head fixtures the way we do for the Eco Pack's light bars. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue and guest count and we will confirm what is possible. For the full spec sheet on both fixtures, including where they sit inside our wider catalog, see [RGBW Spotlights and Moving Style Lighting](/blog/audiovisual-equipment-rental-service/#rgbw-spotlights-and-moving-style-lighting) on our audiovisual equipment rental service pillar. We are not duplicating that detail here.

